[{"code":"not_implemented","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":19,"col":10},"end":{"line":19,"col":11}},"title":"NOT IMPLEMENTED YET","message":"A limit of the compiler: `browser-inline` has no markup value yet; it compiles\nmarkup only as a program's `view`, written in place\n(`docs/design/browser-inline.md` §5, class 1). Write markup held, passed or\nreturned by a helper in place in the `view`, or build this program with\n`--platform=browser-tea`."},{"code":"view_not_compiled","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":27,"col":13},"end":{"line":27,"col":24}},"title":"VIEW NOT COMPILED","message":"`Tea.sandbox` is used here as a value rather than called with its record, so the\nprogram it makes, and that program's `view`, are known only when the page runs.\n\nThe markup lowering `inline` compiles each program where its constructor is\ncalled (`docs/design/browser-direct.md` §11.1), and has no renderer to hand a\n`view` it did not compile. Call `Tea.sandbox` with the program's record here, or\nbuild for `--platform=browser-tea`, which renders any `view`."}]
